MISSION     Enter interact (clues, keypad 257, chest button, doors, wardrobe) / L Buzz laser
SELECT      1 Woody  2 Jessie  3 Bullseye  4 Buzz  5 RC Car  6 Ball  7 Lamp  8 Ghost
            0 nothing   |  left-click any object to select it
LIVE        Selecting a toy keeps the other toys running; 0 releases it; N enters full manual
CHARACTER   W/S move  A/D turn  Shift run  SPACE stop
            R  Jessie mount / dismount Bullseye (must be close)
